BioLoop Monitor - InnoFarm MVP

Library Dependencies (auto-installed via platformio.ini):
- OneWire: DS18B20 communication
- DallasTemperature: Temperature sensor library
- eFLL: Embedded Fuzzy Logic Library (AI core)
- Blynk: Mobile dashboard integration

Project Structure:
- src/main.cpp: Main orchestrator
- src/sensors/: Temperature and moisture reading
- src/control/: Fuzzy logic controller (AI)
- src/actuators/: Fan PWM and pump relay
- include/config.h: All configuration parameters
